<title>UK: EIB sets 300 million mark December 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 300 million mark December 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank GZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.125 PCT MATURITY    30.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.32    PAY DATE   L25.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.945    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> NOTE	 LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 FORCE MAJ  IPMA (2)  GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
